      `the answer under section 790LO(1) for Case 2` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790LO(2) the registrar must direct the entity to deliver the statements` MEANS
    `s 790C(6) both answers hold`
        `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This Part applies to companies other than" (a JUST FALSE from s 790B(1) flows through)
        (`s 790C(7) either answer holds` `the answer under section 790LO(1) for Case 1` `the answer under section 790LO(1) for Case 2`) -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section applies in the following cases." (neither case: fork F8)

@ref s 790LO(2)(a) and (b) the statements (src:10602-10606)
GIVEN `the statement by the entity specifies the name of one of its relevant officers who is an individual and whose identity is verified, and confirms that the individual's identity is verified` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement by the individual confirms that the individual is a relevant officer of the entity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790LO(2) the entity has delivered the statements required` MEANS
    IF    `the statement by the entity specifies the name of one of its relevant officers who is an individual and whose identity is verified, and confirms that the individual's identity is verified`
       AND `the statement by the individual confirms that the individual is a relevant officer of the entity`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "deliver to the registrar, within the period of 28 days beginning with the date of the direction— (a) a statement by the entity that ... and (b) a statement by the individual confirming ..."

@ref s 790LO(2) within the period of 28 days beginning with the date of the direction (src:10602)
GIVEN `the date of the direction` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 790LO(2) the last day for the entity to deliver the statements` MEANS
    `s 790LO(2) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the day` `the date of the direction`

@ref s 790LO(2) the entity delivered the statements within the period (src:10602)
GIVEN `the date of the direction` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the entity delivered the statements` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the day on which the question is asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790LO(2) the entity delivered the statements in time` MEANS
    `s 790D(4)(b) the act was done by the last day of the period` (`s 790LO(2) the last day for the entity to deliver the statements` `the date of the direction`) `the day on which the entity delivered the statements` `the day on which the question is asked` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within the period of 28 days beginning with the date of the direction"

